WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
<v Dana, security desk>Now place each lure: how often it comes, and how often people click.

2
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.940
<v Dana, security desk>Prize draws are rare and easy to spot.

3
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.210
<v Dana, security desk>Delivery notices are common, but rarely fool us.

4
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:18.740
<v Dana, security desk>Payroll messages are rare but convincing. Password resets and invoices are both.
